+// Identity rules are tested hostile half first: names and tags that must stay TWO before those
+// that must collapse into ONE. The parent link of R4.5 is seeded as a stored row so this file
+// does not depend on task 3.4's `set_parent`.
+
+use gpui::TestAppContext;
